# Identity UI build-time settings — copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in.
# Every variable here is PUBLIC: SvelteKit bakes `PUBLIC_*` into the client
# bundle, so nothing secret belongs in this file.
#
# Both have a committed default that works, so an empty `.env` is fine. Set one
# only to point a build somewhere other than the default.

# Reown Cloud (formerly WalletConnect Cloud) project id, overriding
# DEFAULT_PROJECT_ID in `src/lib/crypto/wallet-connect.ts`. It decides whether
# the wallet picker offers WalletConnect alongside injected wallets — the only
# route to a wallet on a browser with no extension (Safari, and mobile).
#
# Get one free at https://dashboard.reown.com and register every origin you
# serve from (http://localhost:5500 for `pnpm dev`). The relay answers 403 to an
# id from an origin its project does not name, which shows up as a WalletConnect
# modal with a blank QR code.
# PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=

# Account-bus signaling server (docs/Account-Bus.md). `pnpm dev` falls back to
# the local server on ws://localhost:5520.
# PUBLIC_BUS_SIGNALING_URL=
